The .msg files in this directory are RFC 5322/2045/2046 conformance test
messages vendored unmodified from Apache James Mime4j's test resources
(core/src/test/resources/testmsgs/), used here to exercise libglot's MIME
parser against a hand-crafted edge-case suite independent of the
SpamAssassin/Enron real-mail corpora already used elsewhere in this repo.

Source: https://github.com/apache/james-mime4j
